    "theorem": "For every Max+ design matrix Y of a conference order n=p\u00b2+1 with D=YY\u1d40=2NP (P the equal-diag rank-d projector): if M_ab=(y_a\u00b7y_b)\u00b2 and FFT=(M\u2212n J)/2, then FFT 1 = (N d) 1. Hence N d is an eigenvalue of FFT and of Gu=F\u1d40F. Proof: D\u00b2=2ND \u21d2 (D\u00b2)_{aa}=2N n; (M1)_a=\u2211_b D_ab\u00b2=(D\u00b2)_{aa}=2Nn; FFT1=(2Nn1\u2212nN1)/2=Nd 1.",
