  "C_direction": {
    "proved": true,
    "theorem": "Let v\u2208R^E have v_e=C_ij for e={i,j}. Then Gu v = (N d) v. Proof: for Max+ y, \u2211_{i<j} y_i y_j C_ij = (1/2) y\u1d40 C y = n p / 2. Hence (Gu v)_e = \u2211_a y_a_i y_a_j \u00b7 (np/2) = (np/2)\u00b7N\u00b7(C_ij/p) = (n N / 2) C_ij = N d v_e."
  },
